=== [HIGH] inventory.py:5  Incorrect price calculation formula ===
regression test: Check if total_price correctly calculates sum of price * quantity. (fails on the current code, as it should)
behavior guard: The total_price function correctly calculates the total for a single item where price times quantity equals price plus quantity. (passes on the current code)
Fix incorrect total price calculation formula by changing addition to multiplication.
